<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1364].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1364&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;WIDDEL FRESHWATER MEDIUM WITH FORMATE AND ACETATE</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl                                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NH<sub>4</sub>Cl                                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;4.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Resazurin                                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;980.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components, adjust pH to 8 and autoclave under a N<sub>2</sub> gas atmosphere.   After cooling, add the following solutions from sterile anaerobic stocks (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized):  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace element solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=439">439</a>)           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Selenite-tungstate solution* (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=431">431</a>)     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin mixture solution* (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=1363">1363</a>)       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1.0 M Sodium formate solution                           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;7.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1.0 M Sodium acetate solution                           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;9.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Readjust pH to 8, if necessary.  Separately autoclave and dry iron metal (grain).  Aseptically distribute the medium and iron metal into culture vessels (e.g., 10 ml medium and 100 mg iron in Hungate tubes) under a N<sub>2</sub> gas stream and seal with butyl rubber stoppers.  Prior to use, add per liter the following solution:  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 5% Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O solution                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml        </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
